.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH xil-sfx-match 1  "xil-sfx-match " 
.SH NAME
xil\-sfx\-match \- Find existing SFX library assets for cues whose declared source is not on disk — the cues that make \*(Aqxil produce\*(Aq refuse to start. Reports by default; \-\-apply copies the match into the show\*(Aqs pool and journals the new source.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBxil\-sfx\-match\fR [\fB\-\-show\fR] [\fB\-\-episode\fR] [\fB\-\-top\fR] [\fB\-\-min\-coverage\fR] [\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-emit\-hints\fR] [\fB\-\-apply\fR] [\fB\-\-accept\-review\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Find existing SFX library assets for cues whose declared source is not on disk — the cues that make \*(Aqxil produce\*(Aq refuse to start. Reports by default; \-\-apply copies the match into the show\*(Aqs pool and journals the new source.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-show\fR \fI<SHOW>\fR
Restrict to one show slug (default: every show in the workspace)
.TP
\fB\-\-episode\fR \fI<EPISODE>\fR
Restrict to one episode tag (e.g. S01E01)
.TP
\fB\-\-top\fR \fI<TOP>\fR [default: 3]
Candidates to report per cue (default: 3)
.TP
\fB\-\-min\-coverage\fR \fI<MIN_COVERAGE>\fR [default: 0.5]
Coverage a candidate must reach to be reported (default: 0.5)
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR
CSV output path, or \*(Aq\-\*(Aq for stdout (default: reports/sfx_match_<date>.csv)
.TP
\fB\-\-emit\-hints\fR [\fI<PATH>\fR]
Also write a paste\-ready pipe\-hint block (default path: reports/sfx_match_hints_<date>.md)
.TP
\fB\-\-apply\fR
Copy each accepted match into the show\*(Aqs SFX pool under the cue\*(Aqs own slug, retitle the copy, and journal the new source. Acts on EXACT and STRONG only unless \-\-accept\-review is given
.TP
\fB\-\-accept\-review\fR
Widen \-\-apply to REVIEW matches. Read the CSV first — a REVIEW tier means the top candidate had no clear margin over its runners\-up
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
With \-\-apply, report every copy and journal record without writing
.TP
\fB\-\-quiet\fR
Suppress the console summary (CSV only)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
